Subject: [PATCH 03/12] Normal form: docstrings match the display; the target's
 implementation paragraph

The display's control and replay sweeps are named by what they do, the record width W is
introduced where it is used, the last record's end flag is stated, the target's sketch gains
an Implementation paragraph (records of choice bit, claimed reads and end flag; states and
actions recomputed, not guessed), and four double blank lines go.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
